WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.601 --> 00:00:03.801
-One of Donald Trump's
former election lawyers

00:00:03.801 --> 00:00:05.167
pled guilty and agreed
to cooperate with Georgia

00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:07.601
prosecutors in a major blow
to Trump's defense.

00:00:07.601 --> 00:00:10.968
Meanwhile, another key player
in the January 6th coup attempt,

00:00:10.968 --> 00:00:12.801
Jim Jordan,
as of this taping,

00:00:12.801 --> 00:00:14.634
still lacks the votes
to become speaker,

00:00:14.634 --> 00:00:17.667
leaving the House GOP in chaos
and causing a backlash

00:00:17.667 --> 00:00:20.167
from fellow Republicans
and Fox News pundits.

00:00:20.167 --> 00:00:22.467
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:22.467 --> 00:00:26.200
♪♪

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.534
There was a major
development today

00:00:28.534 --> 00:00:30.934
and one of the four criminal
cases against Donald Trump.

00:00:30.934 --> 00:00:32.133
And before we move on,

00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:34.701
I just have to say
it's still shocking

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.634
that when discussing
a former president

00:00:36.634 --> 00:00:40.267
I have to say "one of
the four criminal cases"

00:00:40.267 --> 00:00:42.000
and you don't even know
which one I'm talking about.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:43.667
It could be the election
interference case,

00:00:43.667 --> 00:00:45.734
the stolen documents case,
the hush money case,

00:00:45.734 --> 00:00:48.701
the Georgia case,
or because the news is so insane

00:00:48.701 --> 00:00:50.367
there could be some
other criminal case

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:52.767
you totally forgot about,
like the investigation

00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:55.501
into what the hell he's hiding
under that bulky jacket.

00:00:55.501 --> 00:00:57.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.434
Looks like a grandpa
trying to sneak a bunch of kids

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:02.100
into an R-rated movie.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:03.767
"You haven't seen 'Porky's'
till you've seen it

00:01:03.767 --> 00:01:04.901
on the big screen!

00:01:04.901 --> 00:01:06.901
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.901 --> 00:01:09.067
Oh, keep it down
while I get us some popcorn."

00:01:09.067 --> 00:01:11.334
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.334 --> 00:01:12.734
Well, today's breaking news

00:01:12.734 --> 00:01:15.334
involves the election
interference case in Georgia

00:01:15.334 --> 00:01:17.367
and specifically one
of Trump's former lawyers

00:01:17.367 --> 00:01:19.100
and co-defendants,
Sidney Powell.

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:21.200
You might remember her
from her mugshot,

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.367
where she looks like
she just realized

00:01:23.367 --> 00:01:25.467
the kid from "The Sixth Sense"
saw her.

00:01:25.467 --> 00:01:27.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:31.534
"Oh, shoot, I'm dead people?"

00:01:31.534 --> 00:01:32.601
Or you might remember Powell

00:01:32.601 --> 00:01:34.100
from that infamous
press conference

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:36.334
she held with Rudy Giuliani
shortly after the election,

00:01:36.334 --> 00:01:38.667
the one where it looked
like A1 steak sauce

00:01:38.667 --> 00:01:40.200
was dripping from his skull.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.033
Not that we want to imply
that anything

00:01:42.033 --> 00:01:44.434
that comes out
of Rudy's head is A1.

00:01:44.434 --> 00:01:46.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.067
Powell made a bunch
of completely

00:01:48.067 --> 00:01:49.834
unhinged claims like these.

00:01:49.834 --> 00:01:52.167
-What we are really dealing
with here

00:01:52.167 --> 00:01:54.834
and uncovering more
by the day

00:01:54.834 --> 00:01:59.734
is the massive influence
of communist money

00:01:59.734 --> 00:02:02.267
through Venezuela, Cuba,

00:02:02.267 --> 00:02:05.067
and likely China
in the interference

00:02:05.067 --> 00:02:08.734
with our elections
here in the United States.

00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:11.133
The Dominion Voting systems,

00:02:11.133 --> 00:02:14.601
the Smartmatic
technology software,

00:02:14.601 --> 00:02:17.434
and the software that goes
in other computerized

00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:20.934
voting systems here as well,
not just Dominion,

00:02:20.934 --> 00:02:24.501
were created in -- in Venezuela

00:02:24.501 --> 00:02:26.901
at the direction of Hugo Chavez

00:02:26.901 --> 00:02:29.634
to make sure
he never lost an election.

00:02:29.634 --> 00:02:31.267
-Do you think when Trump
was watching that,

00:02:31.267 --> 00:02:33.834
he said, "oh, [bleep] it takes
my lawyer a full minute

00:02:33.834 --> 00:02:35.601
to get a cap off his water?

00:02:35.601 --> 00:02:37.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.767 --> 00:02:39.000
Are you seeing this?

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.701
It's taking him a full --
a full [bleep] minute."

00:02:41.701 --> 00:02:44.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:50.100
The other craziest thing
about that clip

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:51.334
is the leopard print.

00:02:51.334 --> 00:02:53.200
I mean, she looks like
she's about to raise hell

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:56.200
at a Tampa PTA meeting.

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.200
"I don't know why
I would call Rosie Revere

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:03.400
an engineer
when she's clearly a lesbian."

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:04.868
Although maybe she knew the cops

00:03:04.868 --> 00:03:06.100
would come looking
for her one day

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:08.701
and her plan was to hide
on a couch from the '80s.

00:03:08.701 --> 00:03:10.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:17.300
So, yeah, Sidney Powell claimed
communists in Cuba and China

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:19.367
teamed up with a voting
software company

00:03:19.367 --> 00:03:21.868
and a dead Venezuelan dictator
to steal the election.

00:03:21.868 --> 00:03:25.267
What really throws me off,
though, is how she says

00:03:25.267 --> 00:03:28.501
all those crazy things
in such a flat tone.

00:03:28.501 --> 00:03:29.667
It's like if you were
on the subway

00:03:29.667 --> 00:03:31.167
and a guy just turned to you
and said,

00:03:31.167 --> 00:03:32.534
"Hey, man,
I just wanted you to know...

00:03:32.534 --> 00:03:34.133
CIA is reading my brainwaves

00:03:34.133 --> 00:03:36.267
and using them to guide
Russian satellites.

00:03:36.267 --> 00:03:37.501
Oops, sorry.
This is my stop."

00:03:37.501 --> 00:03:40.467
[ Laughter ]

00:03:42.167 --> 00:03:45.067
At least Rudy has the decency
to scream

00:03:45.067 --> 00:03:46.767
when he's being
a [bleep] nutball.

00:03:46.767 --> 00:03:50.501
-There's no Black America!
There's no white America!

00:03:50.501 --> 00:03:52.834
There is just America!

00:03:52.834 --> 00:03:54.400
Do you think we're stupid?!

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:55.567
You think we're fools?!

00:03:55.567 --> 00:03:58.000
Oh, my goodness.
All the networks.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:01.033
Wow!

00:04:01.033 --> 00:04:03.300
All the networks!

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:05.834
-It's never good when you turn
on the TV

00:04:05.834 --> 00:04:08.534
and your lawyer is making
the "Oh, God, why?" gesture.

00:04:08.534 --> 00:04:10.801
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.801 --> 00:04:12.567
"If the jury says guilty,

00:04:12.567 --> 00:04:14.067
I'll just throw my hands
up in the air.

00:04:14.067 --> 00:04:16.501
Maybe they'll reconsider.

00:04:16.501 --> 00:04:20.033
Oh, God, please give me
a water bottle that opens easy!

00:04:20.033 --> 00:04:22.234
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.234 --> 00:04:26.567
Why have You forsaken me
with these tricky bottle caps?

00:04:26.567 --> 00:04:29.100
A little bit this way,
a little bit that way.

00:04:29.167 --> 00:04:30.901
A little bit this way,
a little bit that way.

00:04:30.901 --> 00:04:33.267
[ Chuckles ]

00:04:33.267 --> 00:04:35.801
A little bit this way,
a little bit -- It's still on."

00:04:35.801 --> 00:04:38.400
[ Laughter ]

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:43.234
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.234 --> 00:04:45.400
But Sidney Powell
didn't yell like that.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:47.901
She had that frightening
monotone, like her voice box

00:04:47.901 --> 00:04:49.801
was set to "Sling Blade."

00:04:49.801 --> 00:04:50.901
True story.

00:04:50.901 --> 00:04:52.234
She asked if Trump could pay her

00:04:52.234 --> 00:04:55.100
[as Karl Childers]
in French fried "potaters."

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.234
[Normally] Powell also
famously promised to provide

00:04:57.234 --> 00:04:59.667
tons of evidence of fraud,
which she never did,

00:04:59.667 --> 00:05:02.167
and used one particularly
memorable phrase.

00:05:02.167 --> 00:05:05.501
-It's been organized
and conducted

00:05:05.501 --> 00:05:07.534
with the help
of Silicon Valley people,

00:05:07.534 --> 00:05:10.767
the the big tech companies,
the social media companies,

00:05:10.767 --> 00:05:12.934
and even the media companies.

00:05:12.934 --> 00:05:15.868
And I'm going to release
the kraken.

00:05:15.868 --> 00:05:18.000
-She did...

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:19.734
She did release the kraken.

00:05:19.734 --> 00:05:22.300
But unfortunately,
the kraken was also indicted.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.701
[ Laughter ]

00:05:24.701 --> 00:05:26.901
I wouldn't be surprised
if Sidney Powell was saying

00:05:26.901 --> 00:05:28.667
she had a literal kraken
in in her house.

00:05:28.667 --> 00:05:30.167
I actually would love
to see a sitcom

00:05:30.167 --> 00:05:32.634
about Sidney Powell
and a kraken living together,

00:05:32.634 --> 00:05:34.534
like "The Odd Couple"
or "Perfect Strangers."

00:05:34.534 --> 00:05:37.300
They could call it
"Kraken Up!"

00:05:37.300 --> 00:05:39.501
Well, today, Powell pled guilty
in the case

00:05:39.501 --> 00:05:43.801
and agreed to testify against
any of her co-defendants,

00:05:43.801 --> 00:05:45.834
which would, of course,
include Donald Trump.

00:05:45.834 --> 00:05:47.400
-Sidney Powell,
who was one of

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:49.868
Donald Trump's
fiercest defenders

00:05:49.868 --> 00:05:52.000
going back to spinning
conspiracy theories

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:53.567
after the 2020 election,

00:05:53.567 --> 00:05:56.234
she's now pleaded guilty
to six charges

00:05:56.234 --> 00:05:58.000
related to election subversion.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.434
-As part of this plea deal,

00:05:59.434 --> 00:06:02.734
she has agreed that she will
testify in any future trials,

00:06:02.734 --> 00:06:04.033
which raises the possibility

00:06:04.033 --> 00:06:06.234
that she could testify
against Trump in the future.

00:06:06.234 --> 00:06:08.734
-So in exchange, Sidney Powell
agreeing to testify

00:06:08.734 --> 00:06:10.834
in all future hearings
and also hand over documents

00:06:10.834 --> 00:06:12.067
and evidence
related to this case.

00:06:12.067 --> 00:06:14.234
Obviously, given her proximity
to Donald Trump

00:06:14.234 --> 00:06:17.033
after the 2020
election, that could be pivotal.

00:06:17.033 --> 00:06:19.033
-That's amazing. She's going
to turn over documents

00:06:19.033 --> 00:06:20.334
and cooperate
with the prosecution.

00:06:20.334 --> 00:06:22.033
Although, how much cooperation

00:06:22.033 --> 00:06:24.067
can a person
that insane really provide?

00:06:24.067 --> 00:06:25.801
What's she going
to tell prosecutors?

00:06:25.801 --> 00:06:28.334
"These are notes from the
meeting I had at the White House

00:06:28.334 --> 00:06:30.400
on January 6th
with the president,

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:33.868
Rudy Giuliani,
the kraken, two pegasuses.

00:06:33.868 --> 00:06:36.467
Excuse me, two pegasi.
I don't want to --

00:06:36.467 --> 00:06:38.033
[ Laughter ]

00:06:38.033 --> 00:06:41.868
I don't want to sound
like a crazy person --

00:06:41.868 --> 00:06:43.634
and the ghost of Hugo Chavez.

00:06:43.634 --> 00:06:45.467
We conspired to steal
the election

00:06:45.467 --> 00:06:46.734
and swore an oath of loyalty

00:06:46.734 --> 00:06:49.100
by wearing matching
leopard-print sweaters."

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:52.801
And while Trump's legal mess
gets worse in Georgia,

00:06:52.801 --> 00:06:54.734
the Republicans political mess
gets worse in DC,

00:06:54.734 --> 00:06:56.534
where after more than two weeks

00:06:56.534 --> 00:06:57.901
they still can't agree
on a speaker.

00:06:57.901 --> 00:06:59.868
The circus has gotten
so humiliating

00:06:59.868 --> 00:07:01.767
Republicans are openly
[bleep] on each other.

00:07:01.767 --> 00:07:04.167
We say lots of mean things
about Republicans on this show,

00:07:04.167 --> 00:07:06.601
but I'm not sure I've ever been
as mean to Republicans

00:07:06.601 --> 00:07:08.801
as Republicans are currently
being to themselves.

00:07:08.801 --> 00:07:11.400
Take, for example, Fox News
host Brian Kilmeade,

00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:13.767
who lashed out at the GOP's
embarrassing antics.

00:07:13.767 --> 00:07:16.734
-Ultimately, the Republicans
hope to get a speaker,

00:07:16.734 --> 00:07:19.100
and they hope people
will forget by November

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:20.501
that when they had the majority,

00:07:20.501 --> 00:07:22.334
they could not --
they could not govern.

00:07:22.334 --> 00:07:26.601
Behind the scenes yesterday,
it was all about "vote for me

00:07:26.601 --> 00:07:28.200
because let's make a deal."

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:31.400
I got a feeling a whole bunch
of deals were made yesterday.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:34.033
-It is --
What a carnival of idiots.

00:07:34.033 --> 00:07:35.634
It's unbelievable.
[ Laughter ]

00:07:35.634 --> 00:07:37.734
-First of all, I'm pretty sure
carnival of idiots

00:07:37.734 --> 00:07:41.033
was the original title
of "Fox &amp; Friends."

00:07:41.033 --> 00:07:42.701
I mean, I don't think I've ever
called Republicans

00:07:42.701 --> 00:07:43.734
a carnival of idiots.

00:07:43.734 --> 00:07:44.934
I mean,
I've called them unhinged,

00:07:44.934 --> 00:07:46.467
oatmeal brain,
insurrectionists,

00:07:46.467 --> 00:07:48.834
no neck, mutant freak
mafia goons who look like

00:07:48.834 --> 00:07:51.467
they mistook an electric outlet
for a glory hole.

00:07:51.467 --> 00:07:53.567
[ Laughter ]

00:07:53.567 --> 00:07:55.901
And, yeah, we do use
that Rudy photo a lot.

00:07:55.901 --> 00:07:58.267
But in fairness, we're using it
on our show's merch now.

00:07:58.267 --> 00:08:00.267
We're putting it on a shirt
in the NBC store.

00:08:00.267 --> 00:08:04.300
[ Laughter ]

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:05.934
And yet, even though Republicans

00:08:05.934 --> 00:08:07.667
are all aiming their fire
at each other,

00:08:07.667 --> 00:08:10.100
they're still also finding
time to blame Democrats.

00:08:10.100 --> 00:08:11.567
Some of them even have
the gall to claim that

00:08:11.567 --> 00:08:13.100
because Democrats
did not vote to keep

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:15.000
Republican Speaker
Kevin McCarthy in power,

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:17.868
the whole mess is actually
the fault of Democrats,

00:08:17.868 --> 00:08:20.567
an argument so dumb it led to
this contentious back and forth

00:08:20.567 --> 00:08:22.567
with CNN anchor
Brianna Keilar.

00:08:22.567 --> 00:08:24.067
-The Democrats knew
what they were doing

00:08:24.067 --> 00:08:27.801
when they put up 208 votes to
take him out of the speakership.

00:08:27.801 --> 00:08:31.167
And that's what created the
current situation that we're in.

00:08:31.167 --> 00:08:32.767
So then when we had
a conference meeting --

00:08:32.767 --> 00:08:34.701
-They didn't take him
out of the speakership.

00:08:34.701 --> 00:08:37.100
I mean, you guys are --
-Sure they did.

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:40.000
-But you guys -- you guys
are the majority, right?

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.634
-96% of the votes came from
Democrats, though, Brianna.

00:08:42.634 --> 00:08:44.434
I mean -- I mean,
just factually speaking,

00:08:44.434 --> 00:08:46.000
there were only
eight Republicans

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.067
and there were 208 Democrats.

00:08:48.067 --> 00:08:49.901
I mean, 208 Democrats --

00:08:49.901 --> 00:08:52.934
-But, sir,
who's in the majority?

00:08:52.934 --> 00:08:55.200
-Well, the Democrats were
the majority of that vote.

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:57.133
And when we have --
-No, who's in the majority

00:08:57.133 --> 00:09:00.067
in the House of Representatives?

00:09:00.067 --> 00:09:01.601
-The Republicans are
in the majority,

00:09:01.601 --> 00:09:03.968
but the Democrats provided
the majority of the votes

00:09:03.968 --> 00:09:05.767
to take Kevin McCarthy
out of the speakership.

00:09:05.767 --> 00:09:07.767
In fact, they provided 96% of
the vote.

00:09:07.767 --> 00:09:10.100
-Republicans
provided the key votes.

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:11.100
They're in the majority.

00:09:11.100 --> 00:09:13.000
They can provide
enough votes, obviously,

00:09:13.000 --> 00:09:16.133
to put a Republican speaker
in place.

00:09:16.133 --> 00:09:18.934
-Brianna, the Democrats provided
96% of the votes.

00:09:18.934 --> 00:09:21.300
208 Democrats voted to remove

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:23.033
the Republican speaker
of the House.

00:09:23.033 --> 00:09:24.667
Eight Republicans
voted to remove

00:09:24.667 --> 00:09:26.367
the Republican Speaker
of the House.

00:09:26.367 --> 00:09:28.167
-It's some interesting
verbal gymnastics,

00:09:28.167 --> 00:09:29.300
I will give you that.

00:09:29.300 --> 00:09:30.934
But I want to talk
about the future here.

00:09:30.934 --> 00:09:32.000
-What do you mean gymnastics?

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:33.300
I'm just talking
about the facts.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:35.868
208 Democrats voted.

00:09:35.868 --> 00:09:37.400
There were the vast majority
of the vote

00:09:37.400 --> 00:09:39.000
to take Kevin McCarthy
out of the speakership.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.667
-Well, I'm talking
about how it works.

00:09:40.667 --> 00:09:43.033
-First of all...

00:09:43.033 --> 00:09:45.200
I don't know who that guy is,

00:09:45.200 --> 00:09:46.701
and I'm not going
to learn his name.

00:09:46.701 --> 00:09:49.501
He looks like a stock photo
of a Republican politician.

00:09:49.501 --> 00:09:52.267
Is he in Congress,
or is he just the photo

00:09:52.267 --> 00:09:53.801
that comes in the frame
at Macy's?

00:09:53.801 --> 00:09:56.467
Second, watching this interview
was like

00:09:56.467 --> 00:09:57.734
watching a dementia test.

00:09:57.734 --> 00:09:58.734
Like, what time is it?

00:09:58.734 --> 00:09:59.934
"Well, the clock is round

00:09:59.934 --> 00:10:00.968
and the arrows
point at the numbers."

00:10:00.968 --> 00:10:02.400
Okay. Yeah,
but what time is it?

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:04.300
"That depends on what number
the arrow is pointing at."

00:10:04.300 --> 00:10:05.767
Yeah, but what time is it now?

00:10:05.767 --> 00:10:07.467
"Brianna, at this point, we're
just going around in circles

00:10:07.467 --> 00:10:11.033
like the arrows
on that clock thingy."

00:10:11.033 --> 00:10:12.868
She grilled him so hard
it ended with her

00:10:12.868 --> 00:10:14.834
just checkmating him
into silence.

00:10:14.834 --> 00:10:17.033
-I'm not sure what -- what
I'm missing here with you,

00:10:17.033 --> 00:10:20.801
because 208 Democrats
voted with 8 Republicans

00:10:20.801 --> 00:10:22.701
to take the largest
Republican fundraiser

00:10:22.701 --> 00:10:24.200
out of the speakership.

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:26.667
This was a pretty
calculated decision

00:10:26.667 --> 00:10:27.834
by the Democrats.
I get it --

00:10:27.834 --> 00:10:29.200
-It was -- It was a --

00:10:29.200 --> 00:10:32.000
Here's why, sir,
because it was a Republican

00:10:32.000 --> 00:10:34.267
who filed the motion
to vacate.

00:10:34.267 --> 00:10:36.334
-It was. It was a Republican
that had very,

00:10:36.334 --> 00:10:38.334
very personal differences
with Kevin McCarthy.

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:42.801
[ Laughter ]

00:10:42.801 --> 00:10:45.167
-Alright,
so Jordan lost 22 Republicans.

00:10:45.167 --> 00:10:47.534
-Man, he just powered down
like a Roomba

00:10:47.534 --> 00:10:49.634
that ran out of batteries.

00:10:49.634 --> 00:10:51.133
I haven't seen someone
that deflated

00:10:51.133 --> 00:10:52.734
since a tree fell
on the air dancer

00:10:52.734 --> 00:10:54.801
at my local car dealership.

00:10:54.801 --> 00:10:57.100
Props to Brianna Keilar
for her tough questioning here,

00:10:57.100 --> 00:10:58.501
but it shouldn't be just her.

00:10:58.501 --> 00:11:00.467
This is how Republicans
should be interviewed on...

00:11:00.467 --> 00:11:01.901
-All the networks!

00:11:01.901 --> 00:11:05.567
-So now the House remains
without a speaker.

00:11:05.567 --> 00:11:07.234
With Jordan failing
after two votes

00:11:07.234 --> 00:11:09.000
and still deciding
on whether to hold a third,

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.567
some Republicans
have been floating a plan

00:11:10.567 --> 00:11:12.868
to empower temporary
Speaker Patrick McHenry

00:11:12.868 --> 00:11:13.934
to run the House.

00:11:13.934 --> 00:11:15.467
Right now, all McHenry
can really do

00:11:15.467 --> 00:11:18.267
as interim speaker is oversee
the election of a real speaker

00:11:18.267 --> 00:11:20.534
and gavel the House
in and out of recess.

00:11:20.534 --> 00:11:22.267
And knowing
that's all he can do,

00:11:22.267 --> 00:11:24.868
he's really going for it
with the gavel.

00:11:24.868 --> 00:11:27.334
We've played this clip
a bunch lately,

00:11:27.334 --> 00:11:30.400
so prepare yourself
because it is very loud.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:34.100
[ Explosion ]

00:11:34.100 --> 00:11:36.667
This is the state
of the Republican Party.

00:11:36.667 --> 00:11:38.667
The faraway frontrunner
for the presidential nomination

00:11:38.667 --> 00:11:39.868
is under four indictments

00:11:39.868 --> 00:11:41.767
and the House GOP
can't even pick a speaker.

00:11:41.767 --> 00:11:43.534
I don't know if they have
a plan for what's next,

00:11:43.534 --> 00:11:45.801
but if they want to come up with
one, they better get...

00:11:45.801 --> 00:11:46.667
-Kraken.

00:11:46.667 --> 00:11:48.934
[ Laughter ]

00:11:48.934 --> 00:11:50.367
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:11:50.367 --> 00:11:53.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

